en:
//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310010a00'>
//「お前は……何が望みだ？」
"Hikaru... what do you <br><I>want?</I>"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310020a14'>
//「……む。
//　今度はおまえが光に覇を問うか」
"Oh? Now it's your turn to question my path?"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310030a14'>
//「良かろう！」
"So be it!"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310040a00'>
//「……」
"......"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310050a14'>
//「天の下に、あまねく武の法を布く。
//　……天下布武！」
"I shall spread the Law of Might to the four corners of the earth!"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310060a00'>
//「武の……法？」
"The Law... of Might?"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310070a14'>
//「争う、と云う事。
//　殺す、と云う事」
"Might is death. Might is destruction."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310080a14'>
//「ただそれきりの法だ」
"Might commands us to kill. Nothing more."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310090a00'>
//「それは」
"That's―"

//　違う。
//　統様が――養母が教えた道は、
  No. That's wrong.

  The might my mother, Subaru, spoke of wasn't―

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310100a14'>
//「今更寝惚けたことは言うまいな、景明？
//　いい加減、お前も<RUBY text='・・・・・・・'>村正を理解した</RUBY>はずだぞ」
"You're not going to start with the usual nonsense, are you? You must realize by now what Muramasa represents."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310110a00'>
//「……！」
"!"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310120a14'>
//「……わかっている、か。
//　良し、それでこそだ」
"...You do understand. Good. That makes things easier."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310130a14'>
//「ならば話もしやすい。
//　光はこの武をもって世を照らす」
"The Law of Might shall become the foundation of a new world."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310140a14'>
//「人が人のまま、ささやかにまとまって身を
//寄せ合う時代はここで<RUBY text='・・・・・'>ぶった切る</RUBY>。
//　誰もが欲するままに生き、戦い、殺す――
//そんな時代を導こう！」
"I shall shatter mankind's shell of peace, harmony, and brotherhood, and usher in an age where every individual lives, fights, and kills in accordance with their desires!"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310150a00'>
//「――時代？」
"...A new world?"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310160a00'>
//「時代など来ない。
//　それでは滅びがあるだけだ」
"There will be no world. The path you speak of leads only to ruin."

//　人間の。世界の。
//　意味もない終わりが。
  The end of human civilization. Only an empty wasteland will remain.

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310170a14'>
//「そうだ！」
"Exactly!"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310180a00'>
//「っ……!?」
"!?"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310190a14'>
//「人が滅び去り……
//　最後に勝ち残ったものは<RUBY text='かみ'>天</RUBY>と名乗る資格を
//得る！」
"Mankind will perish, and the last remaining warrior will earn the right to name herself god!"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310200a14'>
//「ここに光の覇道がある」
"Such is my conquest!"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310210a00'>
//「馬鹿な！」
"Madness!"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310220a14'>
//「む。どこかおかしかったか？
//　……いや、そんなことはないはずだ」
"What? Is there something wrong with my plan? ...No, I'm pretty sure it's foolproof."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310230a14'>
//「論理的に考えて、神と称し得る方法はこれ
//しかない！
//　<RUBY text='・・・・・・・・・・'>人類全員と戦って勝つ</RUBY>!!」
"If you think about it logically, there's only one way to become a god. Defeat the entire human race in battle!"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310240a00'>
//「――――」
"......"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310250a14'>
//「そのためには、まず全人類を戦いの舞台へ
//上げねばならないが……
//　村正の<RUBY text='うた'>汚染波</RUBY>で光の<RUBY text='こころ'>心格</RUBY>を人々に移し与え
//られるのはもっけの幸いであった」
"Of course, first I need the rest of humanity to join me in the ring. But thanks to Muramasa's song, I am able to tie their hearts to mine."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310260a14'>
//「刃を見れば逃げ惑うばかりの脆弱な人々を
//追い立てて背後から斬るなど、卑怯卑劣。
//　欲するまま戦う猛き獣と成さしめ、対等に
//争ってこそ、勝利が意味を持つ」
"It is, after all, cowardly in the extreme to cut down weaklings who would flee at the mere sight of a blade. Therefore I will make them beasts of lust and fury, able to stand and fight in the grand melee."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310270a14'>
//「おれは<RUBY text='・・'>公正</RUBY>な闘争のはて頂点に立とう。
//　そうして神に至れば――光の<RUBY text='ゆめ'>目的</RUBY>も叶う」
"This must be a㉓<I>fair</I>㉑fight, you see. Only then will victory have meaning. And once I have emerged victorious and claimed my godhood... then my dream will come true at last."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310280a00'>
//「……目的？」
"...Your dream?"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310290a14'>
//「それは、さっきも言ったろう？
//　こういう言葉は幾度も口にせぬものだ」
"Weren't you listening to what I told the shogun? This is a word too precious to be tossed around lightly."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310300a00'>
//「…………」
"......"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310310a00'>
//「……愛……？」
"...Love?"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310320a14'>
//「胸に炎あればこそ……
//　肉体は鍛えられ、戦う<RUBY text='はがね'>鋼鉄</RUBY>となる」
"The crimson flame burning in my heart... that is what gives me the strength to <br>fight."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310330a00'>
//「殺し合わせることが……人間というものに
//対するお前の愛情だとでも言うのか」
"So forcing people to kill each other... is your way of showing them㉓<I>love?</I>"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310340a14'>
//「まさか。
//　……いや、そうであれば良かったのだろう
//が」
"Of course not. Or rather, would that it were."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310350a14'>
//「惜しむらく、光の心は人間すべてを愛せる
//ほど雄大ではなかった。
//　この想いは、ただ<RUBY text='・・・'>一個人</RUBY>へ向けられるもの
//に過ぎない」
"But I am not a saint, able to love the whole of humanity. No, this maiden's heart belongs to one man alone."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310360a14'>
//「…………。
//　景明、乙女にこんな話をさせるな。いくら
//家族のおまえでも、胸の内まで入られては、
//こう……むずがゆいものがある」
"...I'm sorry. This is getting a little personal. Even if you are family, there are some things a girl needs to keep to herself."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310370a00'>
//「……」
"......"

//　――駄目だ。
//　理解できない。
  It's no use. None of this makes any sense.

//　何もかも繋がらない。
//　俺の意識野で光の人物像が線を結ばない。
  Try as I may, I cannot begin to fathom what sort of person㉗<I>this</I>㉗Hikaru is.

//　<RUBY text='ゆめまぼろし'>夢幻</RUBY>と会話をしているかのようだ。
  It's like I'm talking to some kind of apparition, a vision brought on by a fever dream.

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310380a00'>
//「狂っている……」
"You're mad."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310390a14'>
//「そんなことはないぞ」
"I most certainly am not."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310400a00'>
//「狂っている！
//　壊れている！」
"You are! You're completely insane!"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310410a00'>
//「お前は……二年前……
//　山賊団と町の人々を諸共に殺し尽くしてし
//まった時に、狂った！」
"Your mind was destroyed two years ago, when you were forced to slaughter our town."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310420a00'>
//「俺の妹は……
//　光は、あの時に死んだのだ」
"My sister, Hikaru, died that day!"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310430a00'>
//「お前は一匹の魔物に過ぎない。
//　……斬る……」
"You're nothing but a monster wearing her face.
  ...You must be destroyed."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310450a14'>
//「狂ってはいない」
"I'm not insane, Kageaki."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310460a00'>
//「聞かぬ」
"Enough talk."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310470a14'>
//「いや聞け。
//　光は<RUBY text='・・・・'>最初から</RUBY>すべて知っていた」
"No, listen. I knew from the beginning what Muramasa was."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310480a14'>
//「村正が如何なる劒冑であるか」
"I knew what the words of the covenant meant."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310490a00'>
//「……ッ!?」
"!?"

//【村正】
<voice name='村正' class='村正さん' src='voice/md01/0310500a01'>
//《…………》
《......》

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310510a14'>
//「承知の上で、我が物としたのだ」
"I knew, and joined with it all the same."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310520a14'>
//「そしておまえにも与えた……」
"Then I left the other Muramasa to fall into your hands..."

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310530a14'>
//「おまえの手で、母上を殺させるために！」
"...for I knew you would use it to kill my mother!"

//【光】
<voice name='光' class='光' src='voice/md01/0310550a14'>
//「ふフ」
"Hehe!"

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310560a00'>
//「……何と……」
"...Hikaru..."

//【景明】
<voice name='景明' class='景明' src='voice/md01/0310570a00'>
//「何と言った、光ッッ!!」
"HIKARU!!!"
